{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\drawing\\079.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "TIME MANAGEMENT SKILLS", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[174, 72], [877, 90], [876, 139], [173, 121]]}, {"text": "complete an assignment in a specific given time.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[166, 204], [1094, 209], [1093, 266], [165, 261]]}, {"text": "The following points will help you best utilize your time.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[299, 274], [1406, 267], [1406, 323], [299, 329]]}, {"text": "Set Clearand Defined Targets", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[162, 408], [804, 408], [804, 448], [162, 448]]}, {"text": "impossible, discuss it with your teacher.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[144, 673], [923, 669], [923, 712], [144, 717]]}, {"text": "Plan Well", "conf": 0.803, "box": [[139, 805], [345, 805], [345, 846], [139, 846]]}, {"text": "and how.", "conf": 0.786, "box": [[129, 940], [308, 942], [307, 983], [128, 981]]}, {"text": "It is also very necessary to get all the required material ready before", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[254, 996], [1634, 1015], [1633, 1075], [253, 1056]]}, {"text": "you start.", "conf": 0.794, "box": [[123, 1083], [311, 1083], [311, 1120], [123, 1120]]}, {"text": "First Thing First", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[114, 1211], [472, 1217], [472, 1263], [113, 1257]]}, {"text": "It means doing things on the basis of importance. Do the most", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[239, 1278], [1634, 1300], [1633, 1352], [238, 1331]]}, {"text": "yaz e ingilab.com", "conf": 0.86, "box": [[636, 1269], [1044, 1027], [1076, 1082], [668, 1324]]}, {"text": "important things first. It is important to list the tasks you have to do and to", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[102, 1350], [1630, 1374], [1629, 1423], [101, 1399]]}, {"text": "sort them in order of importance.", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[97, 1422], [775, 1435], [774, 1478], [96, 1465]]}, {"text": "Break down tasks", "conf": 0.808, "box": [[85, 1614], [486, 1623], [486, 1663], [84, 1654]]}, {"text": "Break complicated assignments down into steps so that you can", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[209, 1699], [1636, 1733], [1635, 1801], [207, 1767]]}, {"text": "accomplish them one step at a time. Allocate specific time to each step. Try", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[55, 1772], [1631, 1804], [1630, 1873], [54, 1841]]}, {"text": "to complete one task before you go on to the next.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[52, 1846], [1110, 1876], [1108, 1935], [51, 1904]]}, {"text": "76", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[1489, 2171], [1561, 2164], [1566, 2222], [1495, 2229]]}, {"text": "ScannedwithCamScanner", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[1095, 2326], [1273, 2326], [1273, 2343], [1095, 2343]]}]}